  "question": {
    "text": "If the coordinates of the points $A$ and $B$ be $(3,3)$ and $(7,6)$, then the length of the portion of the line $\\mathrm{AB}$ intercepted between the axes is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "ji5or",
      "text": "$\\frac{5}{4}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "D4fb7",
      "text": "$\\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{4}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ORtWN",
      "text": "$\\frac{\\sqrt{13}}{3}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "6RZO2",
      "text": "None of these",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Equation of line $A B$ is $y-3=\\frac{6-3}{7-3}(x-3)$<br />$\\Rightarrow 3 x-4 y+3=0 \\Rightarrow \\frac{x}{-1}+\\frac{y}{3 / 4}=1$<br />Hence required length is $\\sqrt{(-1)^2+\\left(\\frac{3}{4}\\right)^2}=\\frac{5}{4}$.",
    "image": null
  },
